<lb n="26"/>schäffts halber, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnzwyffenlich</unclear> vil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unglyche</unclear> reden für <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohren</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kommen</unclear> möchten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserer</unclear> schuldigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pflicht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> befunden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> un-
